<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!-- Evening catch-up (2026-09-11; second slot added 2026-09-13): GUARDED slots
     that recover a day launchd could not replay. launchd has no memory of
     calendar slots that elapsed while the machine was off (architecture §5.1),
     and measured supply is 56% — which now costs a lost observation from two
     validation samples. The machine is normally OFF at the 06:10 (US) / 16:50
     (HK) slots, so these evening slots are the realistic daily run and
     ops:health's expected cadence; the morning/afternoon jobs stay armed as
     opportunistic bonuses.

     20:30 HKT: after the HK close and BEFORE the US open, so the US lane's
     newest bar is always a completed session.

     23:03 HKT is safe for both lanes ONLY because of the 2026-09-13
     session-close filter (quant-core sessionClosed, applied at the
     fetch/upsert boundary in screen:daily): at 23:03 HKT the US session is in
     progress (open 21:30 HKT in EDT / 22:30 in EST), and the filter guarantees
     Yahoo's still-forming bar never enters the store, so the guard screens the
     previous COMPLETED US session — lag 1, admissible under the promptness
     gate by construction. Without that filter this slot would poison the
     sample it protects.

     scripts/daily-catchup.sh runs a lane only when ops:catchup reports it is
     behind, so a healthy day is a no-op rather than a duplicate run.
     PATH is exported by the script itself (see its header), as in daily-chain.sh —
     every other plist here relies on the script, and a plist PATH is easy to get
     wrong silently: the first version of this one named ~/.local/share/pnpm, which
     does not exist on this machine. Install: scripts/launchd/install.sh -->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <key>Label</key><string>com.agentic-trading.daily-catchup</string>
  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>/Users/yongouyang/projects/agentic-trading/scripts/daily-catchup.sh</string>
  </array>
  <key>StartCalendarInterval</key>
  <array>
    <dict><key>Hour</key><integer>20</integer><key>Minute</key><integer>30</integer></dict>
    <dict><key>Hour</key><integer>23</integer><key>Minute</key><integer>3</integer></dict>
  </array>
  <key>StandardOutPath</key><string>/Users/yongouyang/projects/agentic-trading/logs/daily-catchup.log</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key><string>/Users/yongouyang/projects/agentic-trading/logs/daily-catchup.err.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
